            "reason": "Brain counts all ~192 monthly category sales as available to this plan, but the buyerVolume fact says the 2,300 annual sales are spread across 40 sellers (about 5 a month each). A new listing needing 36 sales is asking for ~19% of the category in 30 days; nothing on the card establishes that share or the listing's traffic, so the volume available to THIS listing is unknown until a live listing measures it."
